Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done enough work for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gents have my word that I'll\Nfind the mansion in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, did anyone\Nsee where Iggy ran off to?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.49,0:03:46.33,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be in the end of the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be in the end of the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you look at it, you will\Nbe in the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second time you will be\Non the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last page in the end of the last page?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
