Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy thought to himself, So that\Nbird is a stand user, same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that it offed that guy\Nwith a giant block of ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must be the guard around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll kill anyone who\Napproaches the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means, that bird's next\Ntarget is probably gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From early on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ancient Egyptians\Nrecognized the prowess of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the noble falcon soaring\Nhigh above the Nile Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:08:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They trained the bird as a hunting\Npartner and considered it a symbol of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horus, guardian deity of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The falcon's vision is able to spot\Nprey from several kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its oculus is forever\Nrepresented by the eye of Horus,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an emblem of protection and royal power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The falcon soaring through\Nthe air is called Pet Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the wielder of the\NStand Horus, God of the Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nervously, Iggy thought, Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I stumbled on Dio's mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd I have to find this place\Ninstead of one of the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's worse, that falcon can use its\Nstand to shoot giant chunks of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a super-powered god, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more like a guard bird.
