Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is a little Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A girl of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some place to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting someone else's battle\Nisn't on my list of things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, even if I were to throw\Ndown with Tweety over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what would I get in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm putting\Nmy life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to bring out that\Nold dumb dog routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird brain will never\Nsuspect them with those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the thing about birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never tell what they're thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my stand could take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, there's a reason I'm\Nmaking a fool out of myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to do with\NJotaro and those other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to your mansion,\Nyou feathered freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? A bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the damn thing moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything\Nlike that bird in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could it fly under a\Ncar so low to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't even try to\Ndodge out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dove without giving\Nit a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems like the freaks\Nlost interest to me, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it only goes on the offensive when people\Ntry to make their way inside the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, if Jotaro and the others\Never end up finding this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll have a hell of\Na time trying to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, that's their\Nproblem to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Butch! Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Butch! Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you guys go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you haven't seen my\Ndogs around, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their names are Butch and\NTiny, if that helps at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a dog, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even if I knew, it's\Nnot like I could answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That collar looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right, it's Tiny's!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, why\Nis it under this gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is there blood on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny and Butch, is he\Ntalking about those big dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that kid thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he tries going under the gate, he'll\Nhave to face the wrath of that bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll murder him! Tiny!\NButch! Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I'm getting so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If some human kid bites a\Nbig one, it's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survival of the fittest, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid die first, as do\Npeople who act recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather stay out of\Nthis, so... Goodbye, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch, come out! This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to take you home!
