Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had finally revealed his stand,\Nconfirming Pet Shop's suspicions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about Iggy's extraordinary\Ncanine abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it, Feather Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to rip you to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The falcon is known for its ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To dive at speeds of over\N300 kilometers per hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it the fastest\Nanimal on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even at its trademark speed, the Falcon\Ncan spot its quarry with pinpoint accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The prey, once discovered, faces a violent\Ndeath by way of razor-sharp talons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just smirk at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I saw the\Ncorners of its beak creep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But birds can't smile, can they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air, it's getting colder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice is coming out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on the bird, I didn't\Nrealize my feet were frozen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stance feet froze too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Icicles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it to me straight, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe that guy has\Nany chance of finding Dio's mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope so,\Nbecause if he can't find it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no one left in the city who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one knows Cairo's complex\Nmaze of streets better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and have some faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faith is something I'm\Nquickly running out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been looking around this godforsaken\Ncity for three days with no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt some beggar will\Nfind the mansion in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starting to sound like\Na broken record, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could at least try\Nto keep a level head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all on edge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until our friend gets back, all we\Ncan do is try talking to the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to make matters worse,\Nwe haven't seen Iggy all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did that\Nstupid mutt run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He better not be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as I've known him, Iggy's\Nalways been somewhat of a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm sure he's just\Nwandering around somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing time before coming back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think all dogs lit up and\Nwag their tails when they saw humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd we get stuck with that little cynic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to get away from it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Stan's ice attack took\Nthe skin right off my paws.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I knew I should have let\Nthat human kid fix his own problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Stan's power is nothing to sneeze at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was no ordinary ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet he still has a few tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get out of here\Nwhile the getting's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about holding a grudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highway!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy disappeared, but\Nwhere could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it. That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best that doesn't hold anything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's strong for a dumb birdbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place reeks but\Nit'll have to do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to keep quiet and hide\Nout down here until he gives up
