Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought you had me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:19:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what you killed was my\Nshape-shifting stand, the fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like them apples, Featherbrain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might want to keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're losing\Na lot of blood there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before this drags out any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should probably know I don't give a\Nrat's ass about you or your master deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we call this a draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a few good hits in with those\Nice missiles, so we're even, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does this guy think he is, Bruce Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Can't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'll stay away\Nfrom your boss's mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what your skin looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stopped your wound from\Nbleeding by freezing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the exit's blocked with ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to cover the whole tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find a way out of this death trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It blocked off this engine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:20:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got me in its crosshairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bird's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more than sheer determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This creep's a freaking killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it catches me,\Nit won't just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll leave me alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's my ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fret my pull-a-loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transcription
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By Casting Words
